# Primary Maths core

Follow [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md). Keep token use low.

- Ship gate: `npm run build` in `primary-learn/`. JSON-only iterate with `npm run check:activities`.
- No app run / screenshots unless James asks. Push to `main`. No PRs. No tests/lint unless asked.
- Content is JSON in `src/data/activities/` (auto-registered). No per-quest JSX. UI in shared runner + question kinds. Phrases in `src/data/copy.ts`.
- Map needs `pathNode` + `difficulty` (`1`/`2`/`3`). `curriculumRef` alone does not place a quest.
- Child-facing copy: UK English, short sentences, no em/en dashes as punctuation. Missing-part: `What goes with {n} to make {total}?`.
- Quest work → `docs/agent/ADD-ACTIVITY.md` + `QUALITY.md` + node in `curriculum/maths.md` + `curriculum/NEXT.md`.
- UI work → `DESIGN.md` + `docs/agent/UI-MAP.md`.
- Deep detail only when needed → `docs/agent/REFERENCE.md`.
